WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,754
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,554 --> 00:00:04,424
A dark cloud is dropping pebbles on the lemonade stand!

3
00:00:05,224 --> 00:00:07,851
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:08,651 --> 00:00:10,172
This is Episode 47.

5
00:00:10,972 --> 00:00:11,877
Pebbles hit the roof.

6
00:00:12,677 --> 00:00:13,574
Friends run away.

7
00:00:14,374 --> 00:00:15,705
Here comes the big umbrella.

8
00:00:16,505 --> 00:00:18,174
It pops open all by itself.

9
00:00:18,974 --> 00:00:19,998
Maya ducks under it.

10
00:00:20,798 --> 00:00:22,127
Pebbles rain down hard.

11
00:00:22,927 --> 00:00:23,875
They bounce right off.

12
00:00:24,675 --> 00:00:26,010
Nothing touches the stand.

13
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:28,028
The lemons stay clean.

14
00:00:28,828 --> 00:00:30,070
The cloud tries harder.

15
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:31,973
A wall of pebbles!

16
00:00:32,773 --> 00:00:33,891
The umbrella holds.

17
00:00:34,691 --> 00:00:35,594
It does not bend.

18
00:00:36,394 --> 00:00:37,520
Friends float back in.

19
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:39,498
Maya pours lemonade.

20
00:00:40,298 --> 00:00:41,241
The cloud gives up.

21
00:00:42,041 --> 00:00:43,467
Not one pebble got through.

22
00:00:44,267 --> 00:00:45,514
That is the big umbrella.

23
00:00:46,314 --> 00:00:49,593
It keeps the stand open when a flood of junk hits all at once.

24
00:00:50,393 --> 00:00:51,479
Now you know Shield!

25
00:00:52,279 --> 00:00:54,213
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

26
00:00:55,013 --> 00:00:55,917
Link in the bio.

27
00:00:56,717 --> 00:00:57,667
See you next time!

